#: data/org.gnome.OfficeRunner.appdata.xml.in:7
#: data/org.gnome.OfficeRunner.desktop.in:2 data/ui/office-runner.ui:7
msgid "Office Runner"
msgstr "Office Runner"

#: data/org.gnome.OfficeRunner.appdata.xml.in:10
msgid "Close your laptop lid and start running"
msgstr "Claude le coperculo de tu portabile e comencia a currer"

#: data/org.gnome.OfficeRunner.appdata.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"Office Runner is a game where tallying up the time taken to go from one "
"place in your office to the other."
msgstr ""
"Office Runner es un joco ubi es pote facer le conto prendite pro vader ab un "
"loco in tu officio al altere."

#: data/org.gnome.OfficeRunner.appdata.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"Incidentally, it will also let you close your laptop lid without the "
"computer going to sleep, which is useful to avoid having to reconnect to the "
"network after your short trip."
msgstr ""
"Incidentalmente, il te lassara clauder le coperculo de tu portabile sin que "
"le computator vade a dormir, le qual es utile pro evitar reconnecter al rete "
"post tu curte viage."

#: data/org.gnome.OfficeRunner.desktop.in:3
msgid "Office game for laptop owners"
msgstr "Joco de officio pro proprietarios de portabiles"

#: data/ui/office-runner.ui:51
msgid ""
" • Click the \"Run!\" button, and then dash to your desk or meeting.\n"
" • You are allowed to close your laptop lid to run faster\n"
msgstr ""
" • Clicca le button \"Curre!\" e curre a tu bureau o incontro.\n"
" • Tu es permittite de clauder le coperculo de tu portabile pro currer plus "
"rapidemente\n"

#: data/ui/office-runner.ui:67
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Regulas"

#: data/ui/office-runner.ui:270 src/office-runner.c:556
msgid "Run!"
msgstr "Curre!"

#: src/office-runner.c:67
msgid "Gold Trophy!"
msgstr "Tropheo de auro!"

#: src/office-runner.c:68
msgid "Silver Trophy!"
msgstr "Tropheo de argento!"

#: src/office-runner.c:69
msgid "Bronze Trophy!"
msgstr "Tropheo de bronzo!"

#: src/office-runner.c:240
msgid "Office Runner is running"
msgstr "Office Runner es in execution"

#: src/office-runner.c:344
#, c-format
msgid "%d.%02d seconds"
msgstr "%d.%02d secundas"

#: src/office-runner.c:482
msgid "Took too long, sorry!"
msgstr "Prendeva troppo tempore, pardono!"

#: src/office-runner.c:503
#, c-format
msgid "You managed to finish the route with the best time ever, <b>%s</b>."
msgstr "Tu ha finite con successo le cursa con tu melior tempore, <b>%s</b>."

#: src/office-runner.c:506
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You managed to finish the route with the 2<span rise=\"2048\">nd</span> best "
"time ever, <b>%s</b>."
msgstr ""
"Tu ha finite con successo le cursa con le 2<span rise=\"2048\">e</span> "
"melior tempore, <b>%s</b>."

#: src/office-runner.c:508
#, c-format
msgid "Only <b>%s</b> separate you from the gold trophy!"
msgstr "Solmente <b>%s</b> te separa del tropheo de auro!"

#: src/office-runner.c:512
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You managed to finish the route with the 3<span rise=\"2048\">rd</span> best "
"time ever, <b>%s</b>."
msgstr ""
"Tu ha finite con successo le cursa con le 3<span rise=\"2048\">e</span> "
"melior tempore, <b>%s</b>."

#: src/office-runner.c:514
#, c-format
msgid "Only <b>%s</b> separate you from the silver trophy!"
msgstr "Solmente <b>%s</b> te separa del tropheo de argento!"

#: src/office-runner.c:523
msgid "Too slow for the podium"
msgstr "Troppo lente pro le podio"

#: src/office-runner.c:524
#, c-format
msgid "You managed to finish the route in <b>%s</b>."
msgstr "Tu ha finite con successo le cursa in <b>%s</b>."

#: src/office-runner.c:527
#, c-format
msgid "Only <b>%s</b> separate you from the bronze trophy!"
msgstr "Solmente <b>%s</b> te separa del tropheo de bronzo!"

#: src/office-runner.c:563
msgid "Done!"
msgstr "Preste!"

#: src/office-runner.c:574
msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "Tenta de novo"
